flowchart TB
U[Driver / Passenger] --> VG[Vehicle Gateway]
SW[Steering Controls] --> VG
TS[Touchscreen] --> VG
MIC[Voice / Microphone] --> VG
GNSS[GNSS] --> VG
CAN[Vehicle CAN-FD] --> VG
PHONE[Smartphone] --> PG[Projection Gateway]

VG --> MEDIA[Media Service]
VG --> NAV[Navigation & Route Service]
VG --> VEH[Vehicle Data Abstraction]
PG --> PROJ[Projection Session Manager]

MEDIA --> AUDIO[Audio Manager]
NAV --> HMI[HMI / Display Manager]
PROJ --> HMI
VEH --> HMI
SEC[Security & Privacy Manager] --> MEDIA
SEC --> NAV
SEC --> PROJ

MEDIA --> FUSION[Context Fusion Engine]
NAV --> FUSION
VEH --> FUSION
PROJ --> POLICY[Driver-Distraction Policy Engine]
FUSION --> POLICY
POLICY --> HMI
FUSION --> ML[Personalization / Recommendation ML]
ML --> MEDIA
FUSION --> LOG[Event / Telemetry Logger]

HMI --> CENTER[Center Display]
HMI --> CLUSTER[Instrument Cluster / HUD]
AUDIO --> SPK[Speakers]
PROJ --> PUI[Projection UI]
LOG --> CLOUD[Cloud Services]
VG <--> CLOUD

VG -. USB/IP, Ethernet, CAN-FD .- PG
PHONE -. Wi-Fi / Bluetooth .- PG
